Package: qml-module-org-ukui-quick-items
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: QML items adapted to the UKUI theme style.
 This package contains a QML plugin which implements
 many QtQuick items for application development in UKUI.

Package: qml-module-org-ukui-quick-platform
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Utility interfaces for style control.
 This package contain a QML plugin which implements
 interfaces for getting style parameters in UKUI
 desktop environment, such as palette, radius,
 lite mode state, etc.

Package: libukui-quick-core1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: QML items adapted to the UKUI theme style.
  C++ API for getting properties and using QtQuick items
  for application development in UKUI. This Package provides
  run time library for ukui-quick::core.

Package: libukui-quick-platform1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Utility interfaces for style control.
  C++ API for getting style parameters in UKUI
  desktop environment such as palette, radius,
  lite mode state, etc. This Package provides
  run time library for ukui-quick::platform.

Package: libukui-quick-framework1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: QML widgets plugin framework for UKUI.
  Framework for QML widget plugins development in UKUI.
  This Package provides run time library for
  ukui-quick::framework.

Package: libukui-quick-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         libukui-quick-core1 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libukui-quick-platform1 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libukui-quick-framework1 (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Development files for ukui-quick.
 ukui-quick is a framework for application development
 in UKUI based on QtQuick.This package contains the
 header development files used for building applications
 base on ukui-quick.

Package: libukui-quick-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: API documentation for ukui-quick.
 This package contains generated qdoc/qch API documentation
 artifacts for ukui-quick modules, including core,
 framework, items, and platform.

Package: ukui-quick-cmake-modules
Section: devel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: CMake helper modules for ukui-quick.
 This package contains reusable CMake helper modules,
 qdoc template files, and documentation style resources
 for projects building with or extending ukui-quick.

Package: qml-module-org-ukui-quick-modules
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Extra QML modules for ukui-quick.
 Plenty of QML modules, each one is a encapsulated
 independent function based on ukui-quick, like
 window thumbnail, etc.
